## Pavé & Micropavé Settings in Platinum: $1,400 to $3,230

Pavé settings add brilliant-cut diamond accents to the platinum band. The contrast between the step-cut emerald cut center stone and the brilliant-cut band diamonds creates complementary visual layers. Platinum holds small accent stones more securely than white gold over years of daily wear — denser metal resists the micro-movement that loosens pavé prongs over time.

