## Halo Settings in Platinum: $2,050 to $3,585

Halo settings in platinum add a ring of brilliant-cut diamonds around the emerald cut center stone. For a rectangular step-cut stone, the halo follows the emerald cut's rectangular outline — creating a precise diamond frame around the step-cut table. The platinum structure holds halo stones securely; dense metal resists the spreading and loosening that affects halo prongs in white gold over years of wear.

**Pavé Diamond Halo Ring in Platinum (Cushion, Emerald, Radiant) by James Allen — [$2,050](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/pave-diamond-halo-engagement-ring-in-platinum-cushion-emerald-radiant-by-james-allen-item-314926?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** (69 reviews)

The entry halo for emerald cuts in platinum. Specifically designed for rectangular-cornered shapes — cushion, emerald, radiant. 69 reviews.

The rectangular halo follows the emerald cut's outline precisely, the halo and center reading as one larger rectangle from above.

[![Platinum emerald cut diamond engagement ring halo setting](/images/emerald-cut-diamond-platinum-ring-halo.avif)](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings?styleIDs=all&MetalType=p&ShapeID=Emerald&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)

**Pavé Diamond Halo Cathedral Ring in Platinum by James Allen — [$2,840](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/pave-diamond-halo-cathedral-engagement-ring-in-platinum-by-james-allen-item-315676?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** (102 reviews)

102 reviews. Cathedral arches add height beneath the halo head, elevating the emerald cut stone and making the step-cut pavilion visible from the side. The halo frames the table while the cathedral elevation adds dimension.

For buyers who want both the halo presence and full stone visibility from every angle.

**Falling Edge Pavé Diamond Halo Ring in Platinum by James Allen — [$3,010](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/falling-edge-pave-diamond-halo-engagement-ring-in-platinum-by-james-allen-item-311110?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** (369 reviews)

369 reviews — the most reviewed halo setting in this lineup. The falling edge design places pavé diamonds that cascade from the halo down the upper band shoulders, creating the impression of diamonds flowing from the halo into the shank. This is the most sophisticated halo design at this price point.

369 reviews at $3,010 is the strongest data point in the platinum halo category. The most validated halo choice in this lineup.

**Blue Nile Studio Heiress Halo Diamond Ring in Platinum (3/8 ct. tw.) — [$3,585](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/blue-nile-studio-heiress-halo-diamond-engagement-ring-in-platinum-3-8-ct-tw-item-195819?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** (51 reviews)

The premium halo in this lineup. Blue Nile Studio designs are BN's proprietary fine jewelry pieces. 3/8 ct.

tw. halo diamond weight. 51 reviews at $3,585 represents buyers with larger budgets who prioritize design refinement.

