## Three-Stone & Special Settings in Platinum: $3,135 to $4,300

Three-stone and special settings place additional diamonds alongside the center emerald cut stone. For the emerald cut, the most architecturally appropriate side stones are other step-cut shapes — baguettes or smaller emerald cuts. They extend the rectangular visual line of the center stone horizontally, turning the face-up view into one continuous step-cut band.

