**Budget buyers:** The [Classic Four Prong at $1,180](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/classic-four-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-platinum-item-194156?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) plus a [lab 1ct IGI F-VVS1 emerald cut](https://www.bluenile.com/lab-grown-diamond-search?shape=emerald&caratMin=0.9&caratMax=1.1&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) totals ~$1,675. The most review-validated platinum setting at the lowest total ring price available.

**Buyers wanting proven results:** The [Classic Four Prong at $1,180 with 1,815 reviews](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/classic-four-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-platinum-item-194156?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is The 1,815 Standard. Pair with a [1ct GIA G-VS2 natural emerald cut](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-search?shape=emerald&caratMin=0.9&caratMax=1.1&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) for approximately $4,180 total.

**Buyers wanting sparkle on the band:** The [French Pavé at $2,150 with 576 reviews](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/french-pave-diamond-engagement-ring-in-platinum-1-4-ct-tw-item-195271?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is the most validated mid-range pavé option. For maximum halo presence, the [Falling Edge Pavé Halo at $3,010 with 369 reviews](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/falling-edge-pave-diamond-halo-engagement-ring-in-platinum-by-james-allen-item-311110?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is the most data-backed choice.

